{"id":"dad686059f3ca152","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","title":"Prime Number","display":"df-prime-number — Prime Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prime-number","aliases":["58-df-prime-number","58-df-prime"],"display":"df-prime-number — Prime Number","depends_on":["[[58-df-omega]]","[[58-df-divisibility]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prime-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prime-number</span><span>58-df-prime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-number — Prime Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\in \\omega\">\\(p \\in \\omega\\)</span> (候选素数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d \\in \\omega\">\\(d \\in \\omega\\)</span> (因子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (整除谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (素数谓词 defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus2\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec q\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec q\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\">\\(\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (canonical prime-factorization predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{Prime}(p) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\np\\in\\omega\\land p&gt;1\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)\\to(d=1\\lor d=p))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{Prime}(p) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\np\\in\\omega\\land p&gt;1\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)\\to(d=1\\lor d=p))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}factorization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S(n,k,\\vec q,\\vec e)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus2\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\vec q\\in\\omega^k\\land\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\land\n\\forall i\\in k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(q_i)\\land\\forall i,j\\in k\\;(i&lt;j\\to q_i&lt;q_j)\\land n=\\prod_{i\\in k}q_i^{e_i}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}factorization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S(n,k,\\vec q,\\vec e)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus2\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\vec q\\in\\omega^k\\land\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\land\n\\forall i\\in k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(q_i)\\land\\forall i,j\\in k\\;(i&lt;j\\to q_i&lt;q_j)\\land n=\\prod_{i\\in k}q_i^{e_i}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是素数（大于 1 and仅有 1 和自身为因子）</li>\n<li>常用记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\mid p\">\\(d\\mid p\\)</span> 在本原子中是已注册谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)\\)</span> 的缩写，而不是另一个未定义关系。</li>\n<li>素数序列和素数计数函数可由此谓词另行递归定义。</li>\n<li>素数用于序列编码：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i &lt; n} p_i^{e_i + 1}\">\\(\\prod_{i &lt; n} p_i^{e_i + 1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>算术基本定理保证上面的分解谓词对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge2\">\\(n\\ge2\\)</span> 有唯一的规范见证；该存在唯一性是定理而非定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a> — 整除关系</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a> — 序列编码</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"58-df-recursive\">58-df-recursive</a> — 递归函数（素数序列是递归的）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p \\in \\omega$ (候选素数，见 [[58-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d \\in \\omega$ (因子，见 [[58-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (整除谓词，见 [[58-df-divisibility]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]] — 整除关系","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]] — 序列编码","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-recursive]] — 递归函数（素数序列是递归的）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p \\in \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d \\in \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus2","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec q\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{Prime}(p) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\np\\in\\omega\\land p>1\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)\\to(d=1\\lor d=p))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}factorization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeFactorization}_S(n,k,\\vec q,\\vec e)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus2\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\vec q\\in\\omega^k\\land\\vec e\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\land\n\\forall i\\in k\\;\\mathrm{Prime}(q_i)\\land\\forall i,j\\in k\\;(i<j\\to q_i<q_j)\\land n=\\prod_{i\\in k}q_i^{e_i}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"d\\mid p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}(d,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i < n} p_i^{e_i + 1}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge2","display":false}],"bytes":1956,"backlinks":[{"id":"bda18e5a40f416fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03087ea1802e2ea2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"4336312c6be144dc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\omega\\to\\omega$ and $\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (prime enumeration and prime predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"ee0e6fd2a5876cee","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"79b32ea25a3ad603","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq V$ (素数谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"f40afef4d16889fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"ac978c566ec8e658","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}\\subseteq\\omega$ (prime predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"3363f2782f9bc6a1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c94c3cae0b898de5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb P$ (prime set, see [[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]])"},{"id":"8333e4d8ffbd048e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\subseteq\\mathbb P$ (set of primes, see [[58-df-prime-number]])"},{"id":"3a870504ed2ae0cf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}$ is the exact prime-number predicate from [[58-df-prime-number]]."},{"id":"7b5e80183bd069e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb{P}$ (prime set, see [[58-df-prime-number]])"},{"id":"8402adceb8770037","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}$ (prime-number predicate, see [[58-df-prime-number]])"},{"id":"a477cc53c38e2d75","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-prime-number]])"},{"id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-984","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt